---
import { smartCityUrl } from '../../data/smart-city-media';
---
<section id="closing" class="closing dark">
      <div class="closing-background">
        <img src={smartCityUrl("call-box-city.webp") ?? "/images/media-placeholder.svg"} alt="An old New York emergency call box" loading="lazy" decoding="async"/>
      </div>
      <div class="closing-content">
        <div class="closing-editorial">
          <p class="chapter-meta"><span>08</span><strong><small>2005 – TODAY</small></strong></p>
          <h2>
            <span class="closing-headline-line">I started by asking</span> 
            <span class="closing-headline-line">how a city could</span> 
            <span class="closing-headline-line">communicate better.</span>
          </h2>
          <div class="closing-support">
            <p>That question led from emergency communications to connected kiosks, citywide networks, software platforms and smart infrastructure.</p>
            <p>I never stopped thinking like an advertising Creative Director. I just started applying it to cities, products and technology.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
